### MCP Server Card Demo — HTTP Requests
### Requires: REST Client extension for VS Code
### Start demo: demo/demo.sh

@thruster    = http://localhost:3001
@navigation  = http://localhost:3002
@lifeSupport = http://localhost:3003
@comms       = http://localhost:3004
@catalog     = http://localhost:3005

# ─── 1. Server Cards (static — no MCP session needed) ────────────────────────

### Thruster Control — Server Card
GET {{thruster}}/.well-known/mcp-server-card.json

###

### Navigation — Server Card
GET {{navigation}}/.well-known/mcp-server-card.json

###

### Life Support — Server Card
GET {{lifeSupport}}/.well-known/mcp-server-card.json

###

### Comms Relay — Server Card
GET {{comms}}/.well-known/mcp-server-card.json

# ─── 2. ORD Catalog (paste URL into playground sidebar) ──────────────────────

### ORD well-known config
GET {{catalog}}/.well-known/open-resource-discovery

###

### ORD document — all 4 MCP servers listed
GET {{catalog}}/ord/v1/documents/catalog

###

### Catalog summary
GET {{catalog}}/api/catalog

# ─── 3. Poor Agent — Before Server Card discovery ────────────────────────────
### Agent has no tools. Watch it fail.

### Poor agent — no discovery
POST {{catalog}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "The thruster is overheating! We need to reduce thrust immediately.",
  "withDiscovery": false
}

# ─── 4. Poor Agent — After Server Card discovery ─────────────────────────────
### Agent reads Server Cards → discovers tools → connects to right MCP server
### → calls check_thruster_status then adjust_thrust_level

### Poor agent — with Server Card discovery
POST {{catalog}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "The thruster is overheating! We need to reduce thrust immediately.",
  "withDiscovery": true
}

###

### Life Support scenario
POST {{catalog}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "CO2 levels are dangerously high in the cabin!",
  "withDiscovery": true
}

###

### Navigation scenario
POST {{catalog}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "How far are we from our destination and when do we arrive?",
  "withDiscovery": true
}

# ─── 5. Playground ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### Paste the ORD URL into the playground to show all 4 servers in the sidebar:
###   https://open-resource-discovery.github.io/mcp-server-card-ui/playground/
###
### ORD URL: http://localhost:3005/.well-known/open-resource-discovery
###
### Or add individual servers by their Server Card URL:
###   http://localhost:3001/.well-known/mcp-server-card.json
###   http://localhost:3002/.well-known/mcp-server-card.json
###   http://localhost:3003/.well-known/mcp-server-card.json
###   http://localhost:3004/.well-known/mcp-server-card.json
